        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <assignments>
        <description>Add the new corporate account to practiceAccounts so the existing Get_Corporate_Practice_Accounts query collects it - its filterLogic is `or` on `Id = $Record.AccountId OR Id IN practiceAccounts`. That way one Update_Accounts numbers both the corp and the practice, with no separate numbering step.</description>
